{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02732","headline":"八咏应制二首 二 · 上官仪","name":"八咏应制二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入丛台，丛台裛春露。\n滴沥间深红，参差散轻素。\n妆蝶惊复聚，黄鹂飞且顾。\n攀折殊未已，复值惊飞起。\n送影舞衫前，飘香歌扇里。\n望望惜春晖，行行犹未归。\n暂得佳游趣，更愁花鸟稀。\n且学鸟声调凤管，方移花影入鸳机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}